456	      // The marker used to route the park, so a worker naming `action` put a failed
457	      // run in a NON-BLOCKING lane: the standing slot freed and the task re-filed the
458	      // next day against a cause nobody had fixed. That is how ClaudiniteCanary
459	      // reached seven copies of one fleet-digest failure and hitbut twenty-two.
460	      //
461	      // The verdict is not discarded — it was always most useful as the human-facing
462	      // instruction, and that is where it now goes, kind and detail both. A run that
463	      // never STARTED is the other thing entirely and keeps its own lane: see the
464	      // `missingSecrets` branch below, where nothing failed because nothing ran.
465	      await converge(api, gh, repo, item, STATUS_RUNNING_EXECUTOR, NEEDS_HUMAN_FAILURE, claim,
466	        `Code-work failed: ${result.why}`
467	        + `${result.triage?.kind ? `\n\nThe worker asks for: **${result.triage.kind}**` : ''}`
468	        + `${result.triage?.detail ? `\n\nThe worker's own verdict: ${result.triage.detail}` : ''}`
469	        + `${result.detail ? `\n\n\`\`\`\n${result.detail}\n\`\`\`` : ''}`);
