491	      // half `parseWorkItemBody` reads) and return it to blocked; the scheduler's
492	      // readiness pass releases it when the moment comes. Silent on the timeline,
493	      // like the roll this replaces: the bumped field is the record, and a retry
494	      // cadence must not grow a comment per wake. An ask whose instant could not
495	      // be read is refused loudly — the worker said "wait", and closing done on
496	      // it would record a pass nobody measured.
